<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Lightning Bolt</h1>
<p>Sphere: Electricity Sphere
Spell Tier: 3
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 30)
Mana: 36
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast lightning bolt &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast lightning bolt</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster forks three fingers at the target and utters the words 
'Ghoules electra', and a bolt of lightning leaps from their hand. The 
better your magic and your electricity sphere, the harder it strikes. It 
does best against clothes and light leather and less against heavier 
armour, and a shield is no use against it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Jolt</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Electrical Shock</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Electricity Resistance</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Electricity Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>